title: DexRoom_Enter
---
<<if not flagged("room_intro")>>
    Dex: Dorm room 214. Home sweet home, if home smelled like gym socks.
    Dex: Uncle Vic left me a letter. Should probably read that.
    <<flag room_intro>>
<<elseif flagged("signed_up")>>
    Dex: Back in 214. I should be sleeping. I'm going to be on TV. I will never sleep again.
<<endif>>
===

title: Bed_Look
---
Dex: A mattress with the springs of a medieval torture device.
===
title: Bed_Use
---
<<if not flagged("found_dollar")>>
    Dex: Under the pillow... a crumpled dollar. The tooth fairy pays in cash.
    <<give dollar>>
    <<flag found_dollar>>
<<elseif flagged("signed_up")>>
    Dex: Sleep? On the night I got on Speed Daters Live? Not a chance.
<<else>>
    Dex: Nothing else under the pillow. No time for naps. The night is young.
<<endif>>
===

title: Mirror_Look
---
Dex: Looking good, Dex Dooley. Looking... adequate.
===
title: Mirror_Use
---
<<if flagged("signed_up")>>
    Dex: Hello, future TV star. Practice the smile. No, less teeth.
<<elseif flagged("won_lacey")>>
    Dex: She danced with me. She DANCED with me. Mirror, you were right all along.
<<elseif not flagged("pep_talk")>>
    Dex: You are a catch. You are charming. You have most of your hair.
    Dex: Confidence up.
    <<add confidence 1>>
    <<flag pep_talk>>
<<else>>
    Dex: Any more pep talk and I'll start believing it.
<<endif>>
===

title: Desk_Look
---
Dex: My desk. A letter from Uncle Vic is taped to it.
===
title: Desk_Use
---
<<if not flagged("read_vic_letter")>>
    Dex: "Dex, my boy. College is about one thing: getting out there."
    Dex: "Talk to people. Help them out. Be the guy who shows up with what they need."
    Dex: "And for the love of all that's holy, don't wear the turtleneck. Love, Uncle Vic."
    <<flag read_vic_letter>>
<<elseif flagged("signed_up")>>
    Dex: P.S. from Uncle Vic: "If you ever get on TV, call me." Gotta find a phone.
<<else>>
    Dex: "Be the guy who shows up with what they need." Uncle Vic, you old genius.
    -> Read the whole letter again
        Dex: "Talk to people. Help them out. And don't wear the turtleneck."
    -> Leave it
        Dex: Message received.
<<endif>>
===

title: DexDoor_Look
---
Dex: The door to the hallway. Freedom, and the smell of microwave popcorn.
===
title: DexDoor_Use
---
<<go dorm_hallway from_room>>
===

title: HallDoor_Look
---
Dex: Room 214. My room.
===
title: HallDoor_Use
---
<<go dex_room from_hallway>>
===

title: Item_dollar_Look
---
Dex: One crumpled dollar. My entire net worth.
===
